<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 4</h3>Unlike previous phases, <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> is very important for every class and spec in the game in Phase 4 and Holy Paladin is no exception. The main use for the emblems this time around is for tier - unlike in TOC, you'll need to buy the base 251 tier item which you can then upgrade via exclusive tokens that drop within the raid, and can't jump tierset item levels without the upfront emblem investment.<br/>
<br/>However, unlike most other specs in the game, you'll only want 2 tier items as the 4pc bonus is very weak and has very poorly itemized pieces. This means you'll quickly have free emblems to purchase additional offpiece gear if you've been unlucky in the first few weeks with loot, or even just to purchase some <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49908/primordial-saronite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felflamebreath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primordial Saronite</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The chest in particular is a major standout option, as it's the best possible option if you only do normal modes - though it's outclassed by several 25H options. It's worth noting that the emblem chest being so well-itemized and having 3 sockets is the main reason we don't want to buy the tier chest, as the regular emblem one is better than all but the 277 ilvl version (and by that time, you should be getting the non contested BiS items for this slot).<br/>The belt and gloves are also okay, but there are many easily obtainable upgrades within the raid from both 25N and 10H so it's recommended to hold off on purchasing these for as long as possible.<br/>
<br/>While there is a cloak option listed, all cloak options are extremely poorly itemized and ANY cloak from ICC, even from 10N, will outperform them, so it's highly advised to skip using emblems on cloaks if at all possible. However, they are a slight upgrade over the 245 preraid bis <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47089/cloak-of-displacement">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Displacement</span></a> if this is your only option.<br/>
