<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 4</h3>Funnily enough, here's the trend yet again of the chest piece being a major offpiece slot with extremely powerful stats. It's worth noting that while the tier item in this slot appears to be good on face value, it's missing a third socket, making it pretty mediocre compared to other, much more easily accessible items. Since the 277 tier token is already extremely contested and hard to acquire and the 277 tier is the only "ok" version to wear, the tier item in this slot has been omitted entirely from the list.<br/>
<br/>It's worth reiterating again how powerful the emblem chest is here. If you're not raiding 25H, it's the best option in the slot bar none and is very easy to acquire, requiring zero raiding. A big no brainer purchase unless you get very lucky with drops. Due to the ease of acquiring this item, nothing below it will be listed.<br/>
