<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 4</h3>The total stat budget on the hands slot is fairly low, so just like cloaks, the impact of this slot is very minor and should generally be looked at as unimportant as far as loot priority goes. Luckily, the best options here are mail and plate, so the contest will be relatively low.<br/>
<br/>There are three cloth haste/<wbr/>hit and haste/<wbr/>spirit options that have been intentionally omitted from the list as they're not BiS while also being possible contests for casters who choose less-contested tier offpieces. As always, check your own raiding situation to see if those two cloth gloves are items you want to go for or not.<br/>
<br/>The top slot is up to preference for whether you want haste/<wbr/>mp5 or haste/<wbr/>crit, or on how highly you value haste as the mp5 gloves have slightly more haste on them. The two options are entirely interchangeable.<br/>
