<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 4</h3>There's a few problems with belts this phase. The top one is very highly contested and caster BiS, while the 2nd and 3rd best options are from fairly difficult fights while having a little bit of contest. Luckily, the belt you can buy with emblems is not too bad, only being about 10 int and 30 haste worse than the BiS option.<br/>
<br/>If you're just trying to fill a starter hole in this gear set, be aware that the BoE belt and the emblems belt are the same exact stats - so if you don't mind paying the gold, you can skip paying the emblems to get a great starter item.<br/>
