<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shields-and-off-hands-for-holy-paladin-healer-phase-4">Shields and Off-Hands for Holy Paladin Healer Phase 4</h4>There are only two shield options in ICC, making it pretty easy to figure out what you should wear. While you can technically use non-shield offhands, they're extremely contested and have lower stat budget than shields anyway, so don't bother.<br/>
